/-! ### merged from `ECDSAAdd.Submission.Entrant.StairLoanExitSupport_at_QTop` -/
section Merge_StairLoanExitSupport_at_QTop

/-!
# The loaned multiplication endpoint stays inside the record endpoint

`bestLoans.endPacket false 68 = StairEndpoint.endPacket760Loan68 false` has
exactly the record endpoint's wrapper structure; only the p-correction is the
loaned `StairLoan.pCorrectionLoan68`.  LT9's `pCorrectionLoan68_support760`
bounds its support by the record correction plus the first 68 carry wires,
and those carries are already used by the record correction (every carry of
`mappedAdd` is a majority target).  Hence

`wires (StairEndpoint.endPacket760Loan68 false) ⊆ wires (R2SqEp760.endPacket760 false)`,

so every single-wire fact the record proves about its multiplication field
transfers to the loaned endpoint.
-/

section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairLoanExitSupport

open ECDSAAdd Arithmetic RecordedQuantum Challenge
open MappedCompressed Secp256k1 BalancedField
