Both arithmetic programs are cut into the same list of pieces
(`selArith_shape`, `refArith_shape`):

```
selected  : W ++ J0sel ++ FP ++ G(1,84) ++ S425 ++ G(85,5) ++ S450 ++ G(90,3) ++ S465 ++ G(93,3)
